From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Artem Butusov <art.sormy@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 07:00:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] media: meson: venc-hevc: log errors only by default

The encoder printed its debug level by default: nine probe lines on
every boot, through a bare printk that lands at warning level. Default
to errors; the print_level parameter still turns the rest on.

Signed-off-by: Artem Butusov <art.sormy@gmail.com>
---
 venc-hevc/vpu.c |    2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff -ruN a/venc-hevc/vpu.c b/venc-hevc/vpu.c
--- a/venc-hevc/vpu.c
+++ b/venc-hevc/vpu.c
@@ -86,7 +86,7 @@
 			printk(x); \
 	} while (0)
 
-static s32 print_level = LOG_DEBUG;
+static s32 print_level = LOG_ERROR;
 static s32 clock_level = 4;
 
 static s32 wave_clocka;
